@startuml
title Hybrid Voice Coaching Workflow

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor Athlete
rectangle "Music Input\nmusic/test-voice.m4a" as Music
component "AudioAnalyzer\nLibrosa + ffmpeg fallback" as Analyzer
component "CoachingEngine\nGemini 2.5 Flash\nStructured JSON" as Gemini
component "TTSEngine\nCue-based parallel TTS" as TTS
component "Programmatic Mixer\npydub overlay + latency compensation" as Mixer
database "Firebase\noptional upload/report" as Firebase
artifact "output_test.mp3" as Output

Athlete --> Music : uploads/selects track
Music --> Analyzer : load + beat extraction
Analyzer --> Gemini : BPM, beat_times, energy_profile
Gemini --> TTS : [{time, text}, ...]
TTS --> Mixer : cue_000.mp3, cue_001.mp3...
Music --> Mixer : original background music
Mixer --> Output : high-quality mixed session
Mixer --> Firebase : upload + save cues
Output --> Athlete : synchronized coaching audio

note right of Gemini
Prep cues are generated for beat-aligned
times near target - 2.0s.
Trigger cues are generated for latency-
compensated beats near target - 0.35s.
end note

@enduml
